Clarae notanda: the binding of WebView2 for the driver of Windows (internal/shell/nativeview)

This folder is a reduced copy, with corrections, of three pieces of the internal packages of Wails v3.1.0
(github.com/wailsapp/wails/v3, internal/webview2). Wails does not export them and the application does not
patch Wails; the driver of the native web views of Windows needs a second WebView2 controller, with an
environment of its own, which the public API of Wails cannot make.

